      "tr": "`ENV DB_PATH=/data/visits.db` ve `VOLUME /data`.",
      "en": "`ENV DB_PATH=/data/visits.db` and `VOLUME /data`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**Dockerfile**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY visits.py .\nENV DB_PATH=/data/visits.db\nVOLUME /data\nCMD [\"python\", \"visits.py\"]\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**Dockerfile**\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM python:3.13-slim\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY visits.py .\nENV DB_PATH=/data/visits.db\nVOLUME /data\nCMD [\"python\", \"visits.py\"]\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "container",
      "run": {
        "volumes": [
          "visits:/data"
        ]
      },
      "expect": {
        "env": {
          "DB_PATH": "/data/visits.db"
        },
        "logs": "db: /data/visits.db visits: 1"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "container",
      "run": {
        "volumes": [
